        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: അറ്റകുറ്റപ്പണി",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "അറ്റകുറ്റപ്പണി — aṟṟakuṟṟappaṇi — \"repairs; maintenance\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മഴക്കാലത്തിന് മുൻപ് വീടിന്റെ അറ്റകുറ്റപ്പണി നടത്തി. maḻakkālattinŭ munpŭ vīṭinṟe aṟṟakuṟṟappaṇi naṭatti. Before the rainy season the house was repaired."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Work on what is broken off and faulty: അറ്റ + കുറ്റ + പണി."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "അറ്റകുറ്റപ്പണി (aṟṟakuṟṟappaṇi) is native Dravidian, a compound of അറ്റ, \"severed\", from അറുക (DEDR 315), കുറ്റ, \"faulty\" (DEDR 1851), and പണി, \"work\" (DEDR 3884)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
